        "\\int_0^\\infty x^{s-1}e^{-ax}\\,dx=\\frac{\\Gamma(s)}{a^s}",
        "\\frac{\\Gamma(5/2)}{4^{5/2}}=\\frac{3\\sqrt\\pi/4}{32}=\\frac{3\\sqrt\\pi}{128}\\approx0.0415"
