        "令 $u=ax^p$：$x=\\left(\\dfrac ua\\right)^{1/p}$",
        "$x\\ge0$ 時 $u=ax^p$ 嚴格遞增，$0\\to0$、$\\infty\\to\\infty$",
        "檢查：$p=1$ 回到 ①；$a=1$、$p=2$、$s=m+1$：",
        "再檢查：$s=3$，$p=3$，$a=1$",
        "直接算：$u=x^3$，$du=3x^2dx$，$\\frac13\\int_0^\\infty e^{-u}du=\\frac13$"
      ],
      "tex": [
        "dx=\\frac1p\\,a^{-1/p}\\,u^{\\frac1p-1}\\,du",
        "\\begin{aligned}x^{s-1}dx&=\\frac1p\\,a^{-\\frac{s-1}p-\\frac1p}\\,u^{\\frac{s-1}p+\\frac1p-1}\\,du\\\\&=\\frac1p\\,a^{-\\frac sp}\\,u^{\\frac sp-1}\\,du\\end{aligned}",
        "\\int_0^\\infty x^{s-1}e^{-ax^p}\\,dx=\\frac{\\Gamma(s/p)}{p\\,a^{s/p}}",
        "\\int_0^\\infty x^me^{-x^2}dx=\\frac12\\Gamma\\!\\left(\\tfrac{m+1}2\\right)",
        "\\int_0^\\infty x^2e^{-x^3}dx=\\frac{\\Gamma(1)}3=\\frac13"
